<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-NETHERLANDS V NEW ZEALAND DAVIS CUP TIE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NETHERLANDS V NEW ZEALAND DAVIS CUP TIE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HAARLEM, Netherlands 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Netherlands took an unbeatable 3-1 lead over New Zealand in their Davis Cup tennis World Group qualifying tie after winning the first singles match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Dutch names first):</p>
<p>Sjeng Schalken beat James Greenhalgh 7-5 6-1 6-7 (5-7) 6-1.  </p>
<p>Dennis van Scheppingen beat Alistair Hunt 3-6 6-3 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Netherlands beat New Zealand 4-1.</p>
</text>
